{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "74a31369-9238-8ad3-8e46-dcb76d213e48",
  "created_at": "2026-01-22T13:42:17-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Colleen Kearney",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Tony Ferreira",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T13:39:03-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Utilities billing, this is Tony. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T13:39:08-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi Tony. Well, I'm not the Queen of England, but the bill here thinks I'm somebody else. I just bought a house and the first water and sewer bill came in the former owner's name."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T13:39:22-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that happens a lot with a new sale. What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T13:39:27-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "103 Chapel Street, up on the Hill. I'm Colleen Kearney."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T13:39:32-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks, Colleen. Let me pull it up. Bear with me a second."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T13:39:37-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. Take your time. I've got nowhere to be but bed, honestly. I work nights as an aide, a nurse's aide, and I haven't slept yet."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T13:39:47-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, long night then. I'll try to be quick. Okay, I see the account. It's still under the previous owner's name. The account doesn't change on its own when the deed does. The city needs the closing information and then we move it over to you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T13:40:04-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Do I need to bring something in, or can I do that over the phone?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T13:40:11-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Usually we just need the date of closing and a copy of the first page of the closing statement or the deed. Do you have a final meter reading from the closing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T13:40:23-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, and I probably can't get one. The meter is down in a crawlspace and nobody goes in there. I haven't been in it, and I don't think the sellers had been in it for years."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T13:40:37-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. So that explains this bill. If nobody's reading it up close, this one is probably an estimate. Estimated just means we calculated it from past usage instead of an actual reading."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T13:40:50-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So it might not even be right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T13:40:54-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, it could be off either way. Is there a remote reader on the outside of the house, a little box on the wall?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T13:41:04-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not that I've seen. I can look when I get a chance. Probably tomorrow after I sleep."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T13:41:11-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. If there's no outside reader, we'd likely send someone to look at the setup. I'll make a note on the account so the estimate gets flagged."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T13:41:22-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Could you put all that in writing for me? What you just told me, about the name and the estimate and the crawlspace. I'd like it on paper so I'm not trying to remember it later."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T13:41:36-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I can send a letter. What mailing address do you want it to go to? The house?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T13:41:43-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, the house. 103 Chapel Street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T13:41:46-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. I'll put in the ownership change, the estimated reading, and the meter location, and note that you'll send the closing paperwork. Do you want me to note a phone number too, in case the meter person needs to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T13:42:02-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, it's 401-555-0189."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T13:42:04-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0189. Anything else I can help with today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T13:42:09-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's it. Thanks, Tony. I'm going to go lie down now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T13:42:14-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You do that. Take care, Colleen."
    }
  ],
